## Usage

### Fitting a sine wave
```bash
python3 -m bokeh serve --show prototype.py
```

or

If you have uv:
```bash
uv run bokeh serve --show prototype.py
```

### MNIST digit detection
```
python3 mnist_detection.py
```

or

If you have uv:
```bash
uv run mnist_detection
```

## Math
MSE:
$$\mathcal{L}_{MSE} = \frac{1}{n} \sum_{i=1}^{n} (y_i - \hat{y}_i)^2$$

Categorical Cross Entropy:
$$\mathcal{L}_CE$$

